"Upload a CSV, XML or XLSX file. Rows are matched by SKU first, or by the existing ID column when no "
"SKU match is found. Importing into the online store updates the WooCommerce product, including stock. "
"Importing into another location updates availability for that location only. If no SKU or ID matches "
"an existing product, the row becomes a manual item at that location."

