"arhivu. Ručne stavke (usluge, dostava) dodijelite na prvom tabu odabirom poslovnice iznad tablice. "
"Brisanje poslovnice briše i te stavke."
msgstr ""
"The online store is the default location: its type, address, code and storage number are included in "
"the official filename (NN 101/2026). Add more locations below. Each receives its own public XML or CSV"
" and a 30-day archive. Assign manual items (services, delivery) on the first tab by selecting a "
"location above the table. Deleting a location also deletes those items."

