"aktivirajte ga. Pri nadogradnji postojećeg dodatka prvo napravite sigurnosnu kopiju."
msgstr ""
"For a fresh installation, go to Plugins → Add New → Upload Plugin, select the SIDRENA ZIP and activate"
" it. Back up first when upgrading an existing installation."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:185
msgid ""
"Za objavu i bez pokretanja WP-Crona pri posjetima, postavite hosting cron svake minute: wp cron event "
"run --due-now --path=/putanja/do/wordpressa. Alternativno pokrenite wp sidrena-cijena regenerate prema"
" rasporedu. Bez posjeta ili vanjskog raspoređivača nema zajamčenog vremena objave."
msgstr ""
"For scheduled publication without relying on visits to trigger WP-Cron, set up a hosting cron job to "
"run every minute: wp cron event run --due-now --path=/path/to/wordpress. Alternatively, schedule wp "
"sidrena-cijena regenerate. Without visits or an external scheduler, the publication time is not "
"guaranteed."

#: includes/admin/tab-upute.php:59
